  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.100,000 Young men and women adopt RA and good business management practices to improve production and incomes. 2.Young men and women access and utilize appropriate and affordable financial products and services to better their enterprises. 3. Enhanced access and control of agricultural resources by 100,000 young men and women  4. Market actors actively engage and source for produce from young men and young women 5.Improved perception by the community and market actors on youth engagement</narrative>
